From 04b4266b068eb113413e6a5350f27b3e5db84e4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@localhost>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:15:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Test compiled VU0 programs against the interpreter

vu_programs.py also writes 4 KiB VU0 images (no EFU, MFP or XGKICK, a
stream pointer that wraps, long programs, one program stopped by XGKICK);
the differential test runs each entry on its own unit, and the generator
tests cover VU0 code sizes, masks and reserved instructions.
---
 ps2xTest/data/vu_programs.py            | 59 ++++++++++++++-----
 ps2xTest/src/ps2_vu1_program_tests.cpp  | 78 ++++++++++++++++---------
 tools/tests/test_compile_vu_programs.py | 64 ++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 154 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)

